      "title": "START HERE / shared fallback chains",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Requires Eclipse 4.4.5 or newer. Only Eclipse + built-in ComfyUI nodes; no model downloads.\n\n1. Run: the four previews show RED, GREEN, RED, RED.\n2. Mute Set_demo_red (Ctrl+M), then Run: GREEN, GREEN, BLUE, GREEN.\n3. Undo the mute or reload this file for a clean start.\n\nUse the numbered groups and the notes on the right. Zoom in to inspect wires."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Requires Eclipse 4.4.5 or newer. Only Eclipse + built-in ComfyUI nodes; no model downloads.\n\n1. Run: the four previews show RED, GREEN, RED, RED.\n2. Mute Set_demo_red (Ctrl+M), then Run: GREEN, GREEN, BLUE, GREEN.\n3. Undo the mute or reload this file for a clean start.\n\nUse the numbered groups and the notes on the right. Zoom in to inspect wires."
