      "title": "TRY A REMOVAL / Safe removal comparison",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Right-click the getter below > Sync chain > Edit shared chain. Delete demo_green and Apply.\n\nThe mixed IMAGE/LATENT member removes GREEN and only its own wire. BLUE stays on the BLUE target and its branch. LATENT keeps its destination.\n\nThe all-IMAGE member in group 5 compacts through its existing output positions. Its last wire is removed.\n\nCtrl+Z restores both members in one step. These two members share a separate chain from groups 1-4."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Right-click the getter below > Sync chain > Edit shared chain. Delete demo_green and Apply.\n\nThe mixed IMAGE/LATENT member removes GREEN and only its own wire. BLUE stays on the BLUE target and its branch. LATENT keeps its destination.\n\nThe all-IMAGE member in group 5 compacts through its existing output positions. Its last wire is removed.\n\nCtrl+Z restores both members in one step. These two members share a separate chain from groups 1-4."
